"Wrote /home/jay/notes.org\nserver.log is larger than 10 MB\nDisk full\n"
; The what-line command.
> (import (lines))
> (define notes (buffers:make "notes" "one\ntwo\nthree\n"))
> (views:set-buffer! (view) notes)
> (views:set-point! (view) 6)
> (in-client (lambda () (commands:run lines:what-line)))
> (echo-area:current-message)
"Line 2"
; The plugin that writes every message to standard error.
> (import (messages-to-stderr))
> (echo-area:message! "Saved ~a" "notes")
Saved notes
